FEATURES             Location/Qualifiers
     rep_origin      1..223
                     /label="pSC101 ori (SmaI/BglII vector form)"
                     /synonym="pSC101 ori (vector form)"
                     /synonym="pSC101 ori (SmaI/BglII)"
                     /note="The SmaI/BglII cloning-vector form of the pSC101
                     origin: the native origin with CCCGGGAGATCT (SmaI + BglII)
                     in place of its bases 32-43. Carried by the pZ expression
                     vectors (Lutz & Bujard 1997) and by many later pSC101
                     vectors; 224 of a 1,390-plasmid collection carry this form
                     and 44 the native one. The two differ only over bases
                     32-43, outside every annotated sub-element of the origin.
                     Like the native form, it carries no temperature-sensitivity
                     claim: that phenotype maps to the rep101 gene (Armstrong et
                     al. 1984)."
